<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Storage Tech estimate upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Storage Tech estimate upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said Wednesday it raised its earnings estimates on Storage Technology Corp for fiscal 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 estimate to $3.78 per share from $3.63.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $4.17 per share from $4.10.</p>
<p>-- Kept short-term buy and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-7/8 to 51-1/8.</p>
</text>
